{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-9-1:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_9_1\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:source:b1d9ad239a9b5caac9aa829d31d627f38db2df2d7505c034163803cca089e22a\",\"evidence:source:77fcc399b93a751e666f00fa7a1c23fe5966fac87042d576d4c39adc384226c0\",\"evidence:source:9e2e17d609b2e2e8d61f45b9aa630042e87e5c1e3fbfa74f023cad3783db0081\",\"evidence:source:5b3aa77ddd0e596a38e3f76192a3d79dcbeb77469a2258d9aa6e06fc3de69cd8\",\"evidence:source:97bed8108bac56a5c29e10f868e9760ed3d2ac8a67e4e3846c8aeb6718dd098e\",\"evidence:source:5f24a7eb6e284afdaa11c3944a1b46ccb73a2598c81de673ddb4ede130b2a172\"],\"blocks\":[{\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"block_id\":\"v2_n_9_1:p1\",\"text\":\"本章中F-VASI=面部VASI。本章疗效评估应以已确认的主要研究目的和主要终点为追溯起点。主要研究目的为：评估R2软膏1.0%每日两次与匹配安慰剂相比，在18-65岁非节段型白癜风伴面部受累成人中第24周面部VASI（F-VASI）较基线变化的优效性。主要终点为：第24周面部VASI（F-VASI）较基线的变化（第24周F-VASI评分−基线F-VASI评分）。疗效评估框架的适用范围与边界应明确界定：【待补充：本章疗效评估框架的适用范围与边界：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"kind\":\"table\",\"block_id\":\"v2_n_9_1:tbl1\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"tbl:v2_n_9_1:endpoint_mapping\",\"block_id\":\"v2_n_9_1:tbl1\",\"title\":\"表1 主要疗效目的、终点与估计目标映射\",\"domain\":\"objectives_endpoints\",\"role\":\"body_content\",\"header_row_count\":0,\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"efficacy:col:objective\",\"label\":\"研究目的\",\"order\":0,\"semantic_role\":\"objective\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"width_twips\":null},{\"column_id\":\"efficacy:col:endpoint\",\"label\":\"疗效终点\",\"order\":1,\"semantic_role\":\"endpoint\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"width_twips\":null},{\"column_id\":\"efficacy:col:estimand\",\"label\":\"估计目标\",\"order\":2,\"semantic_role\":\"estimand\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"width_twips\":null}],\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"efficacy:row:primary\",\"order\":0,\"label\":\"主要\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"source_locator\":\"\",\"cells\":[{\"cel